764	  /* The L2H_MAILBOX (0x40002000) is on the LPSYS APB bus.  Its CxIER
765	   * register is only writable when the LPSYS bus bridge is active.
766	   * Wake the LCPU first so the bus bridge is powered, THEN open the
767	   * IPC queue (which writes CxIER to unmask the mailbox RX interrupt).
768	   * The SDK reference ipc_hw_enable_interrupt2() has the same
769	   * HAL_HPAON_WakeCore() before the UNMASK call.
770	   */
